  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing MIFUMI UK&apos;s advocacy, learning and governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIFUMI UK works with and supports MIFUMI Uganda in its innovative and successful work to strengthen community-based responses to gender-based violence. Mifumi UK has been involved in a lengthy strategic planning process, supported by external mentors, to review how it can most effectively strengthen its support for Mifumi Uganda. This has identified the three areas of advocacy; learning and sharing; and strengthening governance and finance to work on. Mifumi UK now wants to intensify and strengthen its advocacy work to influence funders and peer organisations to address gender-based violence more effectively. It also wants to strengthen its new board to take on their role more effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
